WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.955
Module 11.

00:00:01.955 --> 00:00:04.035
Hedging & Risk Engineering.

00:00:04.035 --> 00:00:06.070
Part of Stage 4, Strategist.

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:09.635
By the end of this module, you'll be able

00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:12.386
to hedge the risks you don't want, stress-test the

00:00:12.386 --> 00:00:15.005
portfolio, and have an incident plan ready.

00:00:15.005 --> 00:00:16.360
That's the standard.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.330
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:22.183
There are 5 lessons, starting with Hedging

00:00:22.183 --> 00:00:24.740
price exposure with perps and options.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:26.719
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:26.719 --> 00:00:28.990
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.980
If the topic is new to

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:35.000
you, start with Mastery Starter 11.0.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.895
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:36.895 --> 00:00:39.049
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:39.049 --> 00:00:41.180
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:42.987
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:42.987 --> 00:00:45.020
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:49.005
Let's begin, with lesson 11.0.
